    "result": "**Answer:** The average listed price of electronics products is **$52.96** (avg over the 6,346 `items_g2` rows that have a non-null price; USD dollars).\n\nNotes on verification:\n- `items_g2` is the electronics dataset — its `main_cat` distribution is dominated by electronics categories (Computers 5,247 / All Electronics 4,562 / Camera & Photo 2,789 / Cell Phones 1,775 / Home Audio & Theater 1,248 / Car Electronics 346 / Video Games, etc.), matching the g2→electronics mapping in memory.\n- `items_g2` has both `prc` (USD cents) and `prc_usd` (USD dollars); 13,654 rows have NULL `prc_usd`, so the average is taken over the priced subset (SUM 336,062.98 / 6,346).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"answer\": \"$52.96 (average listed price of electronics products, computed as AVG(prc_usd) over the 6,346 priced items in items_g2)\",\n  \"sql\": \"SELECT AVG(prc_usd) AS avg_price_usd FROM items_g2 WHERE prc_usd IS NOT NULL;\"\n}\n```",
